$ whycant -u alice delete /srv/keep/pinned

✗ alice (uid 1000) cannot delete /srv/keep/pinned

  /                  drwxr-xr-x      root:root    ✓ traverse
  /srv               drwxr-xr-x      root:root    ✓ traverse
  /srv/keep          drwxrwxrwx      root:root    ✓ delete from
  /srv/keep/pinned   -rw-rw-rw- [i]  alice:alice  ✗ delete   ← blocked here

Why
  /srv/keep/pinned has the immutable attribute: it cannot be changed, renamed or deleted,
  not even by root.

Fixes (safest first)
  1. Remove the attribute (someone set this on purpose; find out why first):
       sudo chattr -i /srv/keep/pinned
